<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Posts on your site title</title><link>https://koooge.github.io/hugo-theme-geppaku/ja/post/</link><description>Recent content in Posts on your site title</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ja-JP</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 03 May 2016 11:03:05 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://koooge.github.io/hugo-theme-geppaku/ja/post/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>月白のインストール方法</title><link>https://koooge.github.io/hugo-theme-geppaku/ja/post/2016/05/how-to-install-geppaku-theme/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 May 2016 11:03:05 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://koooge.github.io/hugo-theme-geppaku/ja/post/2016/05/how-to-install-geppaku-theme/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Geppaku is bluish white theme for &lt;a href="http://gohugo.io/"&gt;Hugo&lt;/a&gt;.&#10;It is color name in Japan. Chinese character is &amp;ldquo;月白&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;月白（げっぱく）とは、月の光を思わせる薄い青みを含んだ白色のことです。&#10;&lt;small&gt;via &lt;a href="http://irocore.com/geppaku/"&gt;http://irocore.com/geppaku/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Geppaku is the white color including a thin blue that reminiscent of the light of the moon.&#10;(If that translate is wrong, please inform me using PullRequest.)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="screenshot"&gt;&#10;&lt;a class="heading" href="#screenshot"&gt;&#10; Screenshot&#10; &lt;svg height="22px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22px" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71 0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="index-page"&gt;&#10;&lt;a class="heading" href="#index-page"&gt;&#10; Index page&#10; &lt;svg height="22px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22px" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/&gt;&#10; &lt;path d="M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71 0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://koooge.github.io/hugo-theme-geppaku/list.png" alt="list"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>